<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32725" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκπορ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make to go out, fetch out,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1068
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>HF</u>
				723
			</span></i> :—
				Med.
			, with fut.
			
				Med.
			 (<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				5.1.8
			</span></i>) and aor.
			
				Pass.
			, <i>go out</i> or <i>forth, march out,</i> X.l.c.,
			etc. ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ λείαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aen.Tact.
					24.4
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς στρατείαν ἐ.</span>
			<i>to march out</i> to a place.., <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				11.9.4
			</span></i> : c. acc. loci, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τὸ
			βουιευτήριον</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				8
			</span></i> ; but 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τοῦ χάρακος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					6.58.4
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τοῦ στόματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Pr.</u>
					3.16
				</span></i>
			, al.: more generally, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅ θ᾽ ὑγρὸς εἰς γῆν ὄμβρος
					ἐκπορεύεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Critias
					25.36
				</span></i>
			.</div>
